  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Fit an LDA topic model to uploaded literary texts after language-aware lemmatization and part-of-speech filtering, then inspect topics, their spread across text chunks, the coherence score and a token-level preprocessing trace, and export the results in a reproducible form. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
